Most things from the bones are cursed, so they are currently of little use.
First, drop the heavy spellbooks. Then try to get a bag or sack. One level
below the Oracle you will find a second stair up; you can solve the Sokoban
levels and may (with 50% probability) find a bag of holding at the end. You
